# What belongs in version control here, and what does not.
#
# Committed: everything needed to run the app AND to run any command the README
# documents, from a fresh clone, with no build step. That is why
# web/data/model_weights.json, web/icons/*.png and tests/parity_cases.json are NOT
# listed below — the project's claim is that it runs with nothing installed, so a
# checkout has to be able to open index.html and score a patient, and to run
# `node tests/parity_test.js` on its own, without first executing a training job.
#
# Ignored: databases, bytecode, byproducts nothing reads, and machine-specific
# configuration. All of it is rebuilt by ./run_all.sh.

# --- generated by server/bootstrap.py (stage 1 of run_all.sh) ---
server/nirogya.db
server/nirogya.db-journal
server/nirogya.db-wal
server/nirogya.db-shm
# cohort.csv is written for inspection only; nothing reads it back. Note that a
# `#` only starts a comment at the START of a line — put one after a pattern and
# it becomes part of the pattern, which silently matches nothing.
server/cohort.csv

# --- the throwaway copy stage 8 serves so the tests never touch the demo data ---
server/nirogya_e2e.db
server/nirogya_e2e.db-journal
server/nirogya_e2e.db-wal
server/nirogya_e2e.db-shm

# --- Python bytecode ---
# Worth being strict about: this repo already carried cpython-310 .pyc files into
# an environment running 3.13. Stale bytecode that shadows edited source is a
# genuinely confusing way to lose an evening before a demo.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- machine-specific editor and tool configuration ---
# Absolute local paths and per-user settings. Not source, not reproducible on a
# teammate's laptop, and no use to anyone reading the submission.
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# --- run artifacts ---
*.log
nirogya_e2e_server.log

# --- scratch ---
# Probe scripts written while debugging. Prefixed with _ by convention so they
# are obvious in a listing and never mistaken for part of the suite.
tests/_*.py
tests/_*.mjs
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.tmp
tests/parity_cases.json.tmp

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
